70
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:26,000
However, you can edit the length of the upper and lower lines separately.

71
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:29,000
Click OK to extend the panel.

72
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:32,000
Complete all the editing and modification operations.

73
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:35,000
Let's check the seam allowance type again.

74
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:40,000
After updating, we can easily open or close the folding option through the secondary selection window.

75
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:45,000
And you can use the shortcut key, the single icon key next to the return key on the keyboard,

76
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:48,000
to make it more convenient to switch between the folding and the seam allowance.

77
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:52,000
After completing the edit and sewing of the panel,

78
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:55,000
