79
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:58,000
We can edit it according to our needs.

80
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:00,000
When selecting the button,

81
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:02,000
under the width of the mouse pointer,

82
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:05,000
