92
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:30,000
It can automatically mark the panels in the correct model library.

93
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,000
If there is a leak,

94
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:33,000
we can also select the category of the component,

95
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:35,000
then select the corresponding panel,

96
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:37,000
press Enter to return to the car,

97
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:39,000
