105
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:56,000
Once you modify it,

106
00:05:56,000 --> 00:06:00,000
the name of the original component will also be changed as you go.

107
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:03,000
Insert this pleated vest and select the fabric.

108
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:05,000
The current clothing type is wool.

109
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:07,000
There is a new option below,

110
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:09,000
