220
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:10,000
Now you can see the chain and the component in the style image rendering.

221
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:14,000
This makes the style effect picture of the clothes more complete.

222
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:17,000
Next, click on the virtual model.

223
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:20,000
Find the sample modifier in the property editor.

224
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:24,000
You can now quickly modify the color of the virtual model's eyes.

225
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:27,000
After the modification is complete,

