00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:47,000
If you want to continue, you can click on Yes.

234
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:52,000
A lower particle diameter can make your picture look more realistic.

235
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:56,000
You can open the rendering window to check the rendering effect.

236
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:59,000
In addition, in the rendering window,

237
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:02,000
